# Revenue Concentration & Pareto Analysis (Excel)

This Excel workbook contains the cleaned and formatted source data used for SQL and Power BI analysis.

## Files Included
- Transactions_1997
- Transactions_1998
- Products
- Customers

## Data Preparation Performed
- Converted raw datasets into Excel Tables
- Standardized data types and formatting
- Verified consistency across source files
- Prepared data for SQL joins and Power BI modeling

## Purpose
The workbook serves as the structured data foundation for analyzing revenue concentration across brands and products.
